Package: companion-os-base
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Companion Intelligence <support@ci.computer>
Description: CI-OS base system package
 Base system package for CI-OS that provides OS identity,
 branding, default configurations, and system integration.
 .
 This package includes:
  - OS identity files (/etc/os-release, etc.)
  - Default wallpapers and branding assets
  - Plymouth and GRUB themes
  - MOTD configuration
  - System utilities (ci-os-info)
Depends: plymouth, grub-common
